  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes 0.3.0 only writing the companion Ollama Modelfile from the console app's export-gguf command. Modelfile generation now happens inside GgufModelExporter.Export() itself - the single method LlmFromScratchClient.ExportGguf() and every other caller goes through - so it is guaranteed for the packaged SDK too. GgufExportOptions gained WriteModelfile (default true) and ModelfilePath to control this, and GgufExportResult now reports the written ModelfilePath. GGUF export still writes a companion Ollama Modelfile (TEMPLATE/stop sequences/num_ctx) derived from the checkpoint's own control-token metadata, control tokens remain caller-configurable, checkpoints containing NaN/Infinity are still rejected at export time, and repetition-penalty sampling (GenerationOptions.RepetitionPenalty) remains available.",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.3.1",
